UPDATE mmf_composition SET realEstate=0.00, otherAssets=0.00, bankNote='~40% in bank deposits — negotiated fixed deposits (~9–12% p.a.) and call deposits (~6–9% p.a.) with Kenyan banks, used for yield and liquidity.', corporateNote='~20% in corporate short-term debt — commercial paper and corporate notes from listed/large Kenyan issuers, typically priced at a 1–3% spread over T-bills (indicative ~11–14% p.a.). Higher reward, higher credit risk than government paper.', cashNote='~5% in cash & near-cash for daily redemptions — current/settlement accounts and overnight placements (indicative ~3–6% p.a.). This is the liquidity buffer that lets you withdraw quickly.', offshoreNote='~10% in regional / offshore or collective investment schemes — diversification beyond Kenya (East-Africa paper or units in other CIS). Adds breadth but introduces currency and cross-border considerations.', realEstateNote='0% direct real estate. A CMA-regulated money market fund cannot legally hold property — it is restricted to short-term, high-quality, liquid instruments. Use the Other Assets page to track any property you own directly.', otherNote='No other asset classes beyond those listed.' WHERE id=6;
UPDATE mmf_composition SET realEstate=0.00, otherAssets=0.00, bankNote='~65% in bank deposits — the fund''s main engine. A mix of negotiated fixed deposits (indicative ~9–12% p.a.) and call deposits (~6–9% p.a.) with tier-1 and tier-2 Kenyan banks. Large balances let the fund negotiate above retail rates.', corporateNote='No corporate debt in the latest snapshot — the fund stays in government paper and bank deposits.', cashNote='~2% in cash & near-cash for daily redemptions — current/settlement accounts and overnight placements (indicative ~3–6% p.a.). This is the liquidity buffer that lets you withdraw quickly.', offshoreNote='~24% in regional / offshore or collective investment schemes — diversification beyond Kenya (East-Africa paper or units in other CIS). Adds breadth but introduces currency and cross-border considerations.', realEstateNote='Cytonn''s MMF holds 0% direct property — CMA rules forbid it. Cytonn Investments separately runs real-estate and high-yield products outside this fund; do not confuse the two.', otherNote='No other asset classes beyond those listed.' WHERE id=1;
